# raio: run logs and camera photos are private (the room, the people); runtime state is written by raio itself;
# the .html pages are rendered from the .md (jeitinho render.py); studio.css copies come from jeitinho transmute sync;
# the teardown images are third-party (Reddit, YouTube, a LightBurn manual page): notes kept, pictures local
raio/logs/
raio/board/next.json
raio/board/live.json
raio/board/history.json
raio/board/stills.json
raio/board/preview.svg
raio/board/.live.*.tmp
raio/*.html
raio/research/*.html
raio/cam/*.html
!raio/cam/index.html
raio/**/studio.css
!raio/board/studio.css
!raio/cam/studio.css
